<% summary = ->(response, seats) { response == "yes" ? "Attending, #{pluralize(seats, 'seat')}" : "Not attending" } %>
<p>Hi <%= @rsvp.first_name %>,</p>

<p>Someone, hopefully you, used the RSVP form to update the RSVP for this email address (<%= @rsvp.email %>) for the <%= @rsvp.show.name %> house concert on <%= @rsvp.show.start_date %>.</p>

<ul class="summary">
<li>Before: <%= summary.call(@previous[:response], @previous[:seats]) %></li>
<li>Now: <%= summary.call(@current[:response], @current[:seats]) %></li>
</ul>

<p>If you didn’t make this change, or want to update your name, phone number or zip code, <%= link_to "update your reservation", @rsvp_url %>.</p>

<p>thanks!
<br />Paul</p>
